WEBVTT

00:00:05.444 --> 00:00:08.345
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.081 --> 00:00:11.951
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.951 --> 00:00:14.010
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.853 --> 00:00:18.983
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.559 --> 00:00:23.395
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.395 --> 00:00:25.522
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.298 --> 00:00:30.325
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:32.037 --> 00:00:34.807
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.807 --> 00:00:37.435
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:41.305
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.748 --> 00:00:47.412
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:49.922
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.922 --> 00:00:53.119
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:57.129
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.129 --> 00:01:01.190
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.433 --> 00:01:06.063
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:09.330
Let's go!

00:01:12.644 --> 00:01:16.011
"ANGEL IN WHIT E"
BEGINS WIT H AN H

00:01:56.755 --> 00:01:58.222
Hey! How's this look?

00:01:58.824 --> 00:02:01.122
Hm, let's see...
Maybe a little more.

00:02:04.096 --> 00:02:07.395
That's impossible!
There must be some mistake!

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:11.060
I'm afraid it looks
like it's not a mistake.

00:02:11.403 --> 00:02:12.563
It's the truth.

00:02:12.771 --> 00:02:16.508
The Soyokaze...
THAT Soyokaze by itself...

00:02:16.508 --> 00:02:20.274
...destroyed a Raalgon recon
fleet?! Tylor did that?!

00:02:21.413 --> 00:02:23.315
The United Planets Space
Force senior staff...

00:02:23.315 --> 00:02:25.783
...is apparently considering
a promotion for Tylor.

00:02:26.151 --> 00:02:27.584
A promotion?!

00:02:28.053 --> 00:02:30.489
However, it would
look better if...

00:02:30.489 --> 00:02:34.186
...we gave him a
commendation before they do.

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:37.663
Wouldn't you have done
better to have been...

00:02:37.663 --> 00:02:39.790
...a politician than
a soldier, Admiral Fuji?

00:02:39.865 --> 00:02:42.067
I doubt you reached
your position...

00:02:42.067 --> 00:02:44.194
...through physical
prowess, Admiral Mifune.

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:47.429
What commendation should he get?

00:02:47.506 --> 00:02:51.067
As a man who's risked his
life in the battle zone...

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:55.139
...wouldn't you know best
what the Soyokaze deserves?

00:02:55.414 --> 00:02:56.472
You, little!

00:02:56.849 --> 00:02:59.651
Well, I leave the choice
of award to you...

00:02:59.651 --> 00:03:02.142
...the hero of many
historic battles, Admiral.

00:03:18.403 --> 00:03:21.140
A special reward
from the brass, huh?

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:24.632
I'd have been grateful
for a year's worth of booze.

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:27.435
You think the brass
are that smart?

00:03:27.546 --> 00:03:29.241
A talented medic, huh?

00:03:29.781 --> 00:03:33.217
There's no man in the service
who's a better doctor than me!

00:03:33.685 --> 00:03:36.848
Nope. He read in the cards
that it'll be a woman.

00:03:40.259 --> 00:03:44.355
Oh? And I suppose if he drew
a moon card, it'd be a monk?!

00:03:44.796 --> 00:03:48.698
If he's right, I'll give
you my last bottle!

00:03:48.934 --> 00:03:49.866
You're on!

00:03:50.068 --> 00:03:51.262
Hey! They're coming out!

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:46.357
Here!

00:04:47.726 --> 00:04:48.954
Take it!

00:04:59.471 --> 00:05:02.235
Do I tell them? No! No matter
what kind of man he is...

00:05:02.307 --> 00:05:04.502
...the captain is
still the captain!

00:05:04.676 --> 00:05:07.008
I can't do it!

00:05:16.288 --> 00:05:17.915
He's so irresponsible!

00:05:18.123 --> 00:05:19.954
How many times do
I have to tell him?!

00:05:20.359 --> 00:05:21.257
Oh!

00:05:31.703 --> 00:05:32.533
Captain's Quarters

00:05:32.671 --> 00:05:36.334
"Just Knock, And
I'll Come Flying!"

00:05:52.658 --> 00:05:53.590
Come in!

00:05:56.895 --> 00:05:57.953
Excuse me...

00:06:15.247 --> 00:06:17.681
Sorry about that.
Did I scare you?

00:06:21.253 --> 00:06:24.313
I figured if such a beautiful woman
was coming to this ugly room...

00:06:24.389 --> 00:06:27.051
...she should at least get
a decent welcome party.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:30.557
Care for a drink?

00:06:31.763 --> 00:06:33.253
Thank you very much, sir.

00:06:33.432 --> 00:06:36.026
I'm honored you wanted to
welcome me personally, sir.

00:06:36.101 --> 00:06:39.093
Sorry.
I'm a little flustered.

00:06:39.938 --> 00:06:41.633
It was a bit of a surprise.

00:06:42.107 --> 00:06:43.039
Something wrong?

00:06:43.108 --> 00:06:47.408
Nothing. It's just the way you
moved before was really something.

00:06:47.946 --> 00:06:50.608
Not like a nurse.
More like a lady spy!

00:06:51.817 --> 00:06:54.183
You thought you were in danger,
but didn't get self-conscious.

00:06:54.453 --> 00:06:56.387
Even though you were just
wearing that little skirt!

00:06:57.055 --> 00:06:58.886
What about her skirt?

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:03.591
Yuriko! Good timing!

00:07:03.995 --> 00:07:08.329
Regulations demand that you inform
me when you leave the bridge!

00:07:09.167 --> 00:07:11.829
Come on, relax a little
about all the rules.

00:07:12.137 --> 00:07:13.729
So, have a drink with us?

00:07:13.939 --> 00:07:14.769
Captain!

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:26.310
There we go.

00:07:27.052 --> 00:07:30.613
Now be careful. You don't
want it to get infected.

00:07:31.423 --> 00:07:33.050
Hey! Hurry up!

00:07:37.896 --> 00:07:38.730
Cripes...

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:39.560
What's wrong?

00:07:39.898 --> 00:07:43.869
Huh? Well, you see, I've had a
stomach ache since last night.

00:07:43.869 --> 00:07:45.928
Oh, my! We can't have that.

00:07:46.171 --> 00:07:49.140
Hey, Katori!
What're you doing here?

00:07:49.441 --> 00:07:51.810
Hm? I cut my finger
up on the bridge.

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:55.109
You idiot! Just lick it
and it'll be fine.

00:07:55.347 --> 00:07:57.042
Here, lemme do it.

00:07:58.049 --> 00:08:01.382
Leave me alone!
And why are you here?!

00:08:01.453 --> 00:08:03.221
I thought you couldn't die
even if somebody killed you!

00:08:03.221 --> 00:08:06.324
Listen, if you wanna stay
in prime condition...

00:08:06.324 --> 00:08:09.316
...you gotta get a check-up
once in a while.

00:08:09.728 --> 00:08:11.025
Understand, kid?

00:08:11.596 --> 00:08:12.722
Don't call me kid!

00:08:12.931 --> 00:08:14.199
Ooh, wanna fight, little boy?

00:08:14.199 --> 00:08:15.367
What's your problem, you big...

00:08:15.367 --> 00:08:16.334
Pipe down!

00:08:16.868 --> 00:08:19.666
Be quiet! This is a sick bay!

00:08:19.871 --> 00:08:21.133
All right!

00:08:21.273 --> 00:08:22.240
Sorry, sir.

00:08:33.385 --> 00:08:34.579
What's wrong?!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.450
Are you all right?!

00:08:41.226 --> 00:08:44.923
No, it's nothing.
Just an old war wound.

00:08:45.197 --> 00:08:47.833
Oh, that's awful!
Here, hold onto me.

00:08:47.833 --> 00:08:49.232
Just leave him alone.

00:08:49.901 --> 00:08:52.404
You're just going to spoil him.

00:08:52.404 --> 00:08:55.931
Oh, no, sir! He received
a wound fighting for us!

00:08:56.241 --> 00:08:59.233
I canвЂ™t just ignore it!
Here, come with me.

00:08:59.344 --> 00:09:00.368
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:00.445 --> 00:09:01.469
Are you all right?

00:09:01.847 --> 00:09:02.506
Yeah.

00:09:04.749 --> 00:09:05.340
But...

00:09:10.355 --> 00:09:11.879
Darn it, she fell for it!

00:09:13.992 --> 00:09:15.323
What are you all doing?!

00:09:17.262 --> 00:09:19.025
What's the meaning of this?!

00:09:19.397 --> 00:09:21.228
Slacking off!
Ignoring your duty!

00:09:21.533 --> 00:09:22.465
B-b-but!

00:09:22.801 --> 00:09:24.860
You can't say that
about wounded men.

00:09:25.971 --> 00:09:31.466
Lieutenant, we're all wounded,
thanks to your violent methods.

00:09:32.277 --> 00:09:34.745
What did you say?!
You're calling me violent?!

00:09:35.247 --> 00:09:37.181
Let's hear that again,
Andressen!

00:09:37.482 --> 00:09:39.109
What, you couldn't
hear me before?

00:09:39.551 --> 00:09:41.109
Maybe you need a check-up, too.

00:09:41.386 --> 00:09:42.587
Why, you!

00:09:42.587 --> 00:09:44.714
Sorry about that. I'm back.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:46.418
Oh, my! Look at you.

00:09:47.826 --> 00:09:48.520
What about me?

00:09:49.561 --> 00:09:51.791
Your blood pressure
looks a little high.

00:09:52.831 --> 00:09:55.823
Why don't I come by later
with some stabilizers?

00:09:59.437 --> 00:10:00.904
No, thank you!

00:10:00.972 --> 00:10:02.439
Oh, if you insist.

00:10:04.743 --> 00:10:05.937
If you'll excuse me!

00:10:09.414 --> 00:10:10.881
Damn it!

00:10:12.384 --> 00:10:15.649
Huh? They're what?
What do you mean?

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:19.247
I mean we're facing a general
breakdown in discipline!

00:10:19.524 --> 00:10:21.583
Yuriko, what
sort of breakdown?

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:23.361
Think of cats in heat.

00:10:23.361 --> 00:10:24.396
Commander Star!

00:10:24.396 --> 00:10:25.363
Lieutenant.

00:10:25.997 --> 00:10:29.057
They're just a little more
turned on than usual.

00:10:29.167 --> 00:10:33.001
Men are all like that.
Don't you agree?

00:10:34.639 --> 00:10:36.197
Well, if that's the way it is...

00:10:37.275 --> 00:10:39.573
...why don't you let Harumi
give you a check-up, too?

00:10:39.678 --> 00:10:41.407
I think it would calm you down.

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:44.615
Nothing lifts your spirits
like seeing a beautiful woman.

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:46.349
Right, Yuriko?

00:10:47.852 --> 00:10:50.685
I love that stoic beauty of yours.

00:10:51.623 --> 00:10:55.525
Oh, and I think your back is
pretty enchanting, too, Miss Kim!

00:10:55.694 --> 00:10:56.592
Thank you!

00:10:57.529 --> 00:10:57.995
Right?

00:11:01.199 --> 00:11:03.167
Hey! Let's take a break!

00:11:03.268 --> 00:11:04.496
Sure. Why not?

00:11:15.747 --> 00:11:17.908
REC ROOM

00:11:33.665 --> 00:11:35.792
Okay, there you go.
No problems.

00:11:36.401 --> 00:11:39.165
Oh, but my heart
is beating so fast!

00:11:39.237 --> 00:11:41.039
And it hurts so much!

00:11:41.039 --> 00:11:41.801
Oh?

00:11:43.375 --> 00:11:45.143
Me next, Harumi!

00:11:45.143 --> 00:11:47.202
Whaddaya mean?! I'm next!

00:11:49.247 --> 00:11:52.011
Christ, they're practically
drooling on her.

00:11:52.083 --> 00:11:56.054
Why not? Compared to the kiddy
lunch-class gals onboard...

00:11:56.054 --> 00:11:58.022
...she's a piece of prime steak!

00:11:58.289 --> 00:12:00.825
Too much steak gives you
too much cholesterol.

00:12:00.825 --> 00:12:01.883
No kidding.

00:12:03.328 --> 00:12:04.522
Pardon me.

00:12:04.763 --> 00:12:05.388
Yes?!

00:12:05.797 --> 00:12:09.028
May I check your
blood pressure, too?

00:12:09.234 --> 00:12:10.064
Blood pressure?

00:12:10.168 --> 00:12:11.931
It'll just take a minute.

00:12:12.003 --> 00:12:15.131
Oh, oh! Look at 'em blush!

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:17.670
My old war wound's acting up
and I've got a fever.

00:12:17.742 --> 00:12:19.733
Sorry for the misunderstanding.

00:12:21.179 --> 00:12:22.771
Old injuries can be
terrible, can't they?

00:12:28.687 --> 00:12:30.678
Didn't she say this would
just take a minute?

00:12:30.755 --> 00:12:32.484
Don't ask me!

00:12:33.058 --> 00:12:35.618
You both must have
such difficult jobs.

00:12:36.461 --> 00:12:38.725
Especially because of Captain Tylor.

00:12:38.897 --> 00:12:42.628
Is working under such a
great man hard to do?

00:12:43.134 --> 00:12:44.499
Tylor? A great man?!

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:53.036
I suppose you only know
what the brass told you.

00:12:53.111 --> 00:12:57.013
Well, I'll admit
he seems a bit odd.

00:12:57.315 --> 00:13:00.443
Oh, you can call him odd.
I call him a full-blown idiot!

00:13:02.253 --> 00:13:04.084
I wish he was JUST an idiot!

00:13:04.155 --> 00:13:06.419
Yeah, he takes it
to a whole new level.

00:13:06.991 --> 00:13:13.264
The way I see it, he's more like
you guys than like the brass.

00:13:13.264 --> 00:13:13.998
Oh, get out!

00:13:13.998 --> 00:13:15.934
That isn't funny!

00:13:15.934 --> 00:13:16.992
You think so?

00:13:17.402 --> 00:13:21.668
Don't you guys have your own rules
and ways of looking at things?

00:13:22.741 --> 00:13:23.639
Well, yeah...

00:13:24.042 --> 00:13:27.478
I think Tylor
has his own, too.

00:13:28.413 --> 00:13:31.349
If he's got anything like that
in him, I'd like to see it.

00:13:31.349 --> 00:13:35.649
When I find it, I'll preserve
it in formalin for you.

00:13:48.166 --> 00:13:50.794
Either someone's talking about
me or I'm getting a cold.

00:13:51.035 --> 00:13:52.229
Either way...

00:13:55.106 --> 00:13:56.437
Captain, where are you going?

00:13:57.876 --> 00:14:02.074
Well, the captain has to maintain
good health at all times, right?

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:04.905
We don't want me to have a
fever during a battle, do we?

00:14:05.216 --> 00:14:06.649
So, you're going
to the sick bay?

00:14:06.718 --> 00:14:09.118
Wrong! To someplace
much healthier than that!

00:14:09.454 --> 00:14:10.188
Care to join me?

00:14:10.188 --> 00:14:11.052
No, thank you!

00:14:11.189 --> 00:14:13.623
Oh. Okay. See you!

00:14:17.195 --> 00:14:19.288
"Someplace much healthier?"

00:14:22.801 --> 00:14:27.761
Excuse me, I've been assigned to
the Soyokaze as a nurse.

00:14:27.872 --> 00:14:28.840
I'm Petty Officer Harumi.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:31.172
Wow! An angel in white!

00:14:31.509 --> 00:14:34.069
I see why all the
men are so excited!

00:14:34.245 --> 00:14:38.181
I'm making up clinical charts on
everyone to help with any treatment.

00:14:38.449 --> 00:14:42.442
That way Captain Tylor won't have
to worry about it in an emergency.

00:14:42.554 --> 00:14:43.851
Oh, Mr. Tylor?

00:14:43.955 --> 00:14:45.752
He's so nice!

00:14:45.824 --> 00:14:47.849
He seems a little strange, though.

00:14:47.959 --> 00:14:49.449
That isn't true!

00:14:49.527 --> 00:14:51.324
Right! He's wonderful!

00:14:51.863 --> 00:14:52.887
Huh? But...

00:14:52.964 --> 00:14:54.261
Is he now?

00:14:54.966 --> 00:14:58.026
It'd take their opinion of
him with a grain of salt.

00:14:58.503 --> 00:14:59.834
What do you mean?

00:15:00.572 --> 00:15:02.039
D-d-don't come near me!

00:15:02.273 --> 00:15:05.538
Keep away! Once step closer
and I'll bite my tongue!

00:15:05.643 --> 00:15:06.871
But I just...

00:15:07.245 --> 00:15:09.475
He's always like this,
Miss Harumi.

00:15:10.281 --> 00:15:12.374
Ensign Kojiro
always acts like this.

00:15:12.517 --> 00:15:14.152
'Cuz he's scared of women.

00:15:14.152 --> 00:15:18.384
But if I don't make up a chart on
him and report to the captain...

00:15:18.623 --> 00:15:21.922
Oh, just make something up!
It's not like he'll care about it!

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:26.553
He's right. Mr. Tylor doesn't
worry about little things.

00:15:26.631 --> 00:15:30.301
She's right. Mr. Tylor has a
heart as big as the universe!

00:15:30.301 --> 00:15:32.098
He's wonderful!

00:15:37.942 --> 00:15:40.172
Well, perhaps
I'll come back later.

00:15:40.245 --> 00:15:42.372
Oh? What about our check-up?

00:15:42.947 --> 00:15:46.280
I'll come back after Ensign
Kojiro has calmed down.

00:15:46.551 --> 00:15:47.142
See you.

00:15:49.954 --> 00:15:52.752
She's wonderful.
So sophisticated.

00:15:52.824 --> 00:15:55.224
I wish I was built like her!

00:15:57.328 --> 00:15:59.023
Those idiots at HQ!

00:15:59.497 --> 00:16:01.863
Why'd they have to send
another woman here?!

00:16:26.824 --> 00:16:28.849
What should I do?!

00:16:30.361 --> 00:16:32.921
Do I tell them or don't I?!

00:16:32.997 --> 00:16:37.661
What?! What?! What?!
What should I do?!

00:17:10.201 --> 00:17:11.532
Bath

00:17:34.926 --> 00:17:37.156
Hey! What do you
think you're doing?!

00:17:37.996 --> 00:17:40.624
An officer and an NCO,
just wandering around!

00:17:40.999 --> 00:17:42.057
Why are you dressed like that?!

00:17:42.133 --> 00:17:42.895
Excuse me.

00:17:44.602 --> 00:17:48.231
Oh, now I see. Aren't you
a little old for this?

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:49.570
What's?

00:17:50.074 --> 00:17:51.701
Flowers, of course!
Surely you can see that!

00:17:51.943 --> 00:17:53.171
We want you to have them!

00:17:54.445 --> 00:17:55.810
Who, me?

00:17:56.414 --> 00:17:57.244
Drop dead.

00:18:00.051 --> 00:18:01.609
We've been waiting
for this chance.

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:04.015
You look surprised.

00:18:04.122 --> 00:18:06.022
Oh, it was you.

00:18:08.393 --> 00:18:10.088
Thank you, they're lovely.

00:18:15.933 --> 00:18:16.922
Sorry to have bothered you.

00:18:19.470 --> 00:18:22.997
Hey! Hold it!
I'm not done with you yet!

00:18:33.117 --> 00:18:37.213
This is HA-RU-MI. I have
arrived on board Tylor's Soyokaze...

00:18:43.494 --> 00:18:46.622
Well, what do you know?
Harumi!

00:18:47.131 --> 00:18:47.927
Tylor!

00:18:49.867 --> 00:18:51.300
What's wrong, Harumi?

00:18:53.271 --> 00:18:56.138
I'm glad to see you like
afternoon baths, too.

00:18:56.474 --> 00:18:58.374
So, wanna let me wash your back?

00:19:00.144 --> 00:19:01.406
Why, yes...

00:19:02.747 --> 00:19:06.376
I think I'll take
you up on that offer.

00:19:06.951 --> 00:19:10.512
Good, good. After all, we'll be
working close together from now on.

00:19:10.855 --> 00:19:12.015
Exactly.

00:19:12.490 --> 00:19:16.426
If I didn't, I might not
find out about the real you.

00:19:16.594 --> 00:19:18.789
Well, this is me.
In the flesh, so to speak.

00:19:20.398 --> 00:19:21.456
Is that so?

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:26.793
Is it true you destroyed a
Raalgon fleet single-handedly?

00:19:26.871 --> 00:19:28.236
Oh, you heard about that?

00:19:28.706 --> 00:19:30.731
That was an accident.
Just an accident.

00:19:31.008 --> 00:19:32.600
Oh, you're too modest.

00:19:33.077 --> 00:19:36.069
I imagined you would be
a very stern, scary man.

00:19:36.147 --> 00:19:40.140
Or does the wolf dress
in sheep's clothing here?

00:19:41.519 --> 00:19:44.181
I want to see the real you...

00:19:50.761 --> 00:19:52.729
Petty Officer Harumi?
Are you okay?

00:19:53.531 --> 00:19:56.500
Oh, is that
Yuriko out there?

00:19:56.701 --> 00:19:58.498
Well, you've got great timing.

00:19:58.803 --> 00:20:00.202
Why don't you join us in here?

00:20:00.705 --> 00:20:02.730
"Join us in here?"

00:20:03.541 --> 00:20:04.235
Is he?!

00:20:06.911 --> 00:20:07.878
Harumi!

00:20:08.379 --> 00:20:09.175
What's wrong?!

00:20:10.982 --> 00:20:15.112
I'm sorry! l... I didn't
realize the captain was in there!

00:20:18.489 --> 00:20:20.320
What... What's going on?

00:20:21.259 --> 00:20:24.228
What got into you?
Do you feel sick?

00:20:25.763 --> 00:20:28.664
Well, why don't you
join me, Yuriko?

00:20:30.268 --> 00:20:32.202
That's the last straw!

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:38.169
Wha... Huh?

00:20:44.949 --> 00:20:46.246
My choice is clear!

00:20:47.018 --> 00:20:48.485
Hey! Finished yet?

00:20:48.953 --> 00:20:50.011
Okay, it's hooked up.

00:20:51.756 --> 00:20:55.556
Yes, this is the UPSF
command carrier Ho-Oh.

00:20:55.826 --> 00:20:57.487
This is the destroyer Soyokaze.

00:20:57.762 --> 00:20:59.787
I have a top secret
report on that battle...

00:20:59.864 --> 00:21:01.855
...a few days ago with
the Raalgon recon fleet.

00:21:02.133 --> 00:21:03.566
May I speak to Vice
Admiral Mifune, please?

00:21:03.868 --> 00:21:04.664
Right away, sir.

00:21:04.869 --> 00:21:05.503
Connecting Call Now

00:21:05.503 --> 00:21:06.904
Connecting Call Now
My choice is clear.

00:21:06.904 --> 00:21:07.638
Connecting Call Now
I'll tell them that Tylor's
victory was entirely accidental...

00:21:07.638 --> 00:21:10.141
I'll tell them that Tylor's
victory was entirely accidental...

00:21:10.141 --> 00:21:14.202
...and that he's
really just an idiot!

00:21:14.645 --> 00:21:15.577
Mifune here.

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:19.313
This is First Officer Yamamoto
of the destroyer Soyokaze!

00:21:19.617 --> 00:21:20.584
Ah, it's you.

00:21:20.885 --> 00:21:25.322
Sir, I apologize for jumping
the chain of command like this...

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:28.989
...but there's something I
must bring to your attention...

00:21:29.427 --> 00:21:31.588
...about that battle
with the Raalgon!

00:21:31.762 --> 00:21:32.751
Oh? What?

00:21:33.798 --> 00:21:37.894
Sir, it wasn't a victory at all!
It was simple luck!

00:21:38.035 --> 00:21:40.196
You could even say
it was an accident!

00:21:40.972 --> 00:21:42.132
An accident?

00:21:44.342 --> 00:21:45.639
You don't know yet?

00:21:46.177 --> 00:21:48.111
No, sir. Forgive me.

00:21:48.546 --> 00:21:51.413
There's too much
conflicting data about Tylor.

00:21:51.882 --> 00:21:54.146
I request more
time to study him.

00:21:54.685 --> 00:21:57.620
You're the best intelligence
analyst in the Empire...

00:21:57.855 --> 00:21:59.755
...and you can't figure him out?

00:22:00.224 --> 00:22:01.851
All right, continue!

00:22:02.193 --> 00:22:02.682
Sir!

00:22:06.297 --> 00:22:11.792
Tylor... What sort of man
are you? What sort of man?!

00:22:12.803 --> 00:22:13.827
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:15.539 --> 00:22:17.439
When a dog faces west,
his tail faces east.

00:22:17.642 --> 00:22:19.744
But when the lizard
drops his tail to escape...

00:22:19.744 --> 00:22:21.769
...you may find it
has spikes on it.

00:22:22.213 --> 00:22:24.738
Next time, "The Tail of
the Lizard's Tail."

00:22:24.982 --> 00:22:25.641
Watch for it.

